{
  "id": "E269",
  "title": "Eight and Nine are Close to Ten",
  "level": "upper intermediate",
  "date": "2018-10-26",
  "synopsis": "Learn a useful Chinese idiom for expressing that something is close to the truth.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/878/cf5d2271cba34303cd12eb004416459c208c1c54.mp3?1539498091",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "八九不离十\n\n保罗的生日就要到了，小乐悄悄为他准备了一份生日礼物，是一部华为手机。在保罗的生日那天，小乐拿出了装着礼物的盒子。\n小乐：你来猜猜这里面是什么？\n保罗：是电子产品吗？\n小乐：你真聪明，猜得八九不离十了。\n保罗：什么八九十啊？什么意思？\n小乐：哈哈哈，我说的是“八九不离十”，意思是和实际情况差不多，也就是说你差不多猜对了！",
    "traditional": "八九不離十\n\n保羅的生日就要到了，小樂悄悄為他準備了一份生日禮物，是一部華為手機。在保羅的生日那天，小樂拿出了裝著禮物的盒子。\n小樂：你來猜猜這裡面是什麼？\n保羅：是電子產品嗎？\n小樂：你真聰明，猜得八九不離十了。\n保羅：什麼八九十啊？什麼意思？\n小樂：哈哈哈，我說的是“八九不離十”，意思是和實際情況差不多，也就是說你差不多猜對了！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Eight and Nine are Close to Ten"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "保罗的生日就要到了，",
      "traditional": "保羅的生日就要到了，",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó de shēng rì jiù yào dào le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "小乐悄悄为他准备了一份生日礼物，是一部华为手机。",
      "traditional": "小樂悄悄為他準備了一份生日禮物，是一部華為手機。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè qiāo qiāo wèi tā zhǔn bèi le yí fèn shēng rì lǐ wù shì yí bù huá wéi shǒu jī",
      "english": "Paul’s birthday is coming up."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "在保罗的生日那天，小乐拿出了装着礼物的盒子。",
      "traditional": "在保羅的生日那天，小樂拿出了裝著禮物的盒子。",
      "pinyin": "zài bǎo luó de shēng rì nà tiān xiǎo lè ná chū le zhuāng zhe lǐ wù de hé zi",
      "english": "Little Le has secretly prepared a birthday present for him. It is a Huawei phone."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "On the day of Paul’s birthday, Little Le takes out the box containing the gift."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "小乐：你来猜猜这里面是什么？",
      "traditional": "小樂：你來猜猜這裡面是什麼？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè nǐ lái cāi cāi zhè lǐ miàn shì shén me",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Litte Le: Guess what’s inside?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "保罗：是电子产品吗？",
      "traditional": "保羅：是電子產品嗎？",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó shì diàn zǐ chǎn pǐn ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: Is it a digital device?"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "小乐：你真聪明，猜得八九不离十了。",
      "traditional": "小樂：你真聰明，猜得八九不離十了。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè nǐ zhēn cōng ming cāi de bā jiǔ bù lí shí le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: You’re really smart. Eight and nine are close to ten."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "保罗：什么八九十啊？什么意思？",
      "traditional": "保羅：什麼八九十啊？什麼意思？",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó shén me bā jiǔ shí a shén me yì si",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: What’s eight, nine, ten? What do you mean?"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "小乐：哈哈哈，我说的是“八九不离十”，",
      "traditional": "小樂：哈哈哈，我說的是“八九不離十”，",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè hā hā hā wǒ shuō de shì bā jiǔ bù lí shí",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "意思是和实际情况差不多，也就是说你差不多猜对了！",
      "traditional": "意思是和實際情況差不多，也就是說你差不多猜對了！",
      "pinyin": "yì si shì hé shí jì qíng kuàng chà bu duō yě jiù shì shuō nǐ chà bu duō cāi duì le",
      "english": "Little Le: Hahaha, I said “Eight and nine are close to ten”."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "It means that something is close to reality. In other words, you guessed almost correctly!"
    }
  ],
